WEBVTT

00:02.438 --> 00:05.565
Water, earth,

00:06.985 --> 00:09.945
fire, air...

00:11.239 --> 00:14.574
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:15.285 --> 00:18.495
Then, everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.664 --> 00:20.914
Only the Avatar,

00:20.999 --> 00:22.582
master of all four elements,

00:22.667 --> 00:23.709
could stop them.

00:23.793 --> 00:25.544
But when the world needed him most,

00:25.628 --> 00:26.920
he vanished.

00:27.338 --> 00:30.507
100 years passed, and my brother
and I discovered the new Avatar,

00:31.259 --> 00:32.926
an airbender named Aang.

00:33.011 --> 00:35.095
And although his
airbending skills are great,

00:35.179 --> 00:38.598
he has a lot to learn
before he's ready to save anyone.

00:39.017 --> 00:41.893
But I believe Aang can save the world.

01:03.666 --> 01:05.125
-Yay! Yay!
-Aang's back!

01:14.010 --> 01:15.052
I knew it.

01:15.136 --> 01:17.262
You signaled the Fire Navy
with that flare.

01:17.555 --> 01:19.598
You're leading them
straight to us, aren't you?

01:19.682 --> 01:21.016
Aang didn't do anything.

01:21.100 --> 01:22.601
It was an accident.

01:22.685 --> 01:24.102
Yeah, we were on the ship

01:24.187 --> 01:25.187
and there was this booby trap,

01:25.271 --> 01:27.064
and, well, we--

01:27.148 --> 01:28.482
We boobied right into it.

01:28.733 --> 01:31.401
Katara, you shouldn't have
gone on that ship.

01:31.694 --> 01:33.528
Now we could all be in danger.

01:33.863 --> 01:35.030
Don't blame Katara.

01:35.114 --> 01:36.698
I brought her there.

01:36.908 --> 01:37.908
It's my fault.

01:37.992 --> 01:38.992
A-ha!

01:39.077 --> 01:40.452
The traitor confesses!

01:40.828 --> 01:42.621
Warriors, away from the enemy!

01:42.705 --> 01:45.082
The foreigner is banished
from our village.

01:45.375 --> 01:47.417
Sokka, you're making a mistake.

01:47.627 --> 01:49.753
No, I'm keeping my promise to dad.

01:49.962 --> 01:51.797
I'm protecting you
from threats like him.

01:52.006 --> 01:54.049
Aang is not our enemy.

01:54.258 --> 01:55.801
Don't you see?

01:56.010 --> 01:57.260
Aang's brought us something

01:57.345 --> 02:00.180
we haven't had in a long time-- Fun.

02:00.431 --> 02:03.183
Fun? We can't fight firebenders
with fun!

02:03.684 --> 02:05.102
You should try it sometime.

02:05.520 --> 02:07.479
Get out of our village, now!

02:07.855 --> 02:10.982
Grandmother, please,
don't let Sokka do this.

02:11.192 --> 02:13.985
Katara, you knew going on
that ship was forbidden.

02:14.070 --> 02:15.654
Sokka is right.

02:15.738 --> 02:18.323
I think it best
if the airbender leaves.

02:18.658 --> 02:21.243
Fine, then I'm banished, too.

02:21.327 --> 02:22.911
Come on, Aang, let's go.

02:23.663 --> 02:25.288
Where do you think you're going?

02:25.498 --> 02:27.040
To find a waterbender.

02:27.250 --> 02:29.418
Aang is taking me to the North Pole.

02:30.294 --> 02:31.294
I am?

02:31.379 --> 02:33.004
- Great!
- Katara!

02:33.548 --> 02:35.882
Would you really choose him
over your tribe,

02:36.384 --> 02:37.634
your own family?

02:43.766 --> 02:46.685
Katara, I don't want to come between
you and your family.

02:49.021 --> 02:51.815
So you're leaving the South Pole?

02:52.442 --> 02:53.733
This is goodbye?

02:54.068 --> 02:55.735
Thanks for penguin sledding with me.

02:55.820 --> 02:57.279
Where will you go?

02:57.363 --> 02:59.906
Guess I'll go back home
and look for the airbenders.

03:00.658 --> 03:01.867
Wow.

03:01.951 --> 03:04.161
I haven't cleaned my room
in 100 years.

03:04.662 --> 03:06.079
Not looking forward to that.

03:09.876 --> 03:11.334
It was nice meeting everyone.

03:11.669 --> 03:14.713
Let's see your bison fly now, Airboy.

03:14.797 --> 03:16.715
Come on, Appa, you can do it.

03:17.049 --> 03:18.049
Yip yip!

03:20.803 --> 03:21.970
Yeah, I thought so!

03:25.600 --> 03:26.725
Aang, don't go.

03:26.809 --> 03:27.976
I'll miss you.

03:28.686 --> 03:29.936
I'll miss you, too.

03:35.359 --> 03:36.693
Come on, boy.

03:46.078 --> 03:48.747
Katara, you'll feel better after you--

03:48.831 --> 03:50.081
You happy now?

03:50.166 --> 03:53.335
There goes my one chance
of becoming a waterbender!

03:58.758 --> 04:00.550
All right, ready our defenses!

04:00.635 --> 04:02.928
The Fire Nation could be
on our shores any moment now!

04:03.012 --> 04:04.054
But I got to--

04:04.138 --> 04:05.597
And no potty breaks!

04:18.236 --> 04:20.278
Yeah, I liked her, too.

04:27.995 --> 04:28.995
The village!

04:34.710 --> 04:35.877
Appa, wait here!

05:42.987 --> 05:44.571
Man!

05:53.789 --> 05:54.956
Man.

06:14.560 --> 06:15.852
Sokka! Get out of the way!

07:29.719 --> 07:30.969
Where are you hiding him?

07:38.519 --> 07:40.228
He'd be about this age,

07:40.312 --> 07:42.230
master of all elements.

07:51.657 --> 07:52.991
I know you're hiding him.

08:05.755 --> 08:07.505
Show no fear!

08:54.970 --> 08:56.596
Hey, Katara. Hey, Sokka.

08:56.806 --> 08:58.348
Hi, Aang.

08:58.432 --> 08:59.432
Thanks for coming.

09:14.532 --> 09:15.824
Looking for me?

09:15.908 --> 09:17.784
You're the airbender?

09:18.285 --> 09:20.411
You're the Avatar?

09:21.205 --> 09:22.205
Aang?

09:22.289 --> 09:23.289
No way.

09:26.544 --> 09:29.504
I've spent years preparing
for this encounter,

09:29.588 --> 09:31.756
training, meditating.

09:32.049 --> 09:34.050
You're just a child.

09:34.134 --> 09:35.343
Well, you're just a teenager.

09:50.150 --> 09:51.526
If I go with you,

09:51.610 --> 09:53.403
will you promise
to leave everyone alone?

10:03.914 --> 10:05.790
No, Aang, don't do this.

10:06.417 --> 10:07.542
Don't worry, Katara.

10:07.626 --> 10:09.711
It'll be ok.

10:09.795 --> 10:10.795
Unh!

10:13.883 --> 10:16.509
Take care of Appa for me
until I get back.

10:16.594 --> 10:18.553
Head a course to the Fire Nation.

10:18.637 --> 10:20.013
I'm going home.

10:59.970 --> 11:02.096
We have to go after that ship, Sokka.

11:02.181 --> 11:03.598
Aang saved our tribe.

11:03.682 --> 11:05.099
Now we have to save him.

11:05.184 --> 11:06.267
Katara, I--

11:06.352 --> 11:08.269
Why can't you realize
that he's on our side?

11:08.604 --> 11:10.563
If we don't help him, no one will.

11:10.648 --> 11:12.857
I know you don't like Aang,
but we owe him and--

11:12.942 --> 11:15.234
Katara, are you going to talk all day

11:15.319 --> 11:16.819
or are you coming with me?

11:17.905 --> 11:18.947
Sokka!

11:21.075 --> 11:22.075
Get in.

11:22.159 --> 11:23.326
We're going to save your boyfriend.

11:23.410 --> 11:24.702
-He's not my--
-Whatever.

11:25.537 --> 11:27.372
What do you two think you're doing?

11:29.333 --> 11:31.125
You'll need these.

11:31.335 --> 11:33.503
You have a long journey ahead of you.

11:36.298 --> 11:39.425
It's been so long since I've had hope,

11:39.718 --> 11:41.427
but you brought it back to life,

11:41.512 --> 11:42.553
my little waterbender.

11:44.932 --> 11:47.558
And you, my brave warrior,

11:47.768 --> 11:49.602
be nice to your sister.

11:50.270 --> 11:52.689
Yeah, ok, Gran.

11:53.482 --> 11:55.024
Aang is the Avatar.

11:55.109 --> 11:57.318
He's the world's only chance.

11:57.403 --> 11:59.696
You both found him for a reason.

12:00.114 --> 12:03.533
Now your destinies
are intertwined with his.

12:05.953 --> 12:07.286
There's no way we're going to catch

12:07.371 --> 12:09.163
a warship with a canoe.

12:13.210 --> 12:14.293
Appa!

12:14.378 --> 12:16.337
You just love taking me
out of my comfort zone,

12:16.422 --> 12:17.422
don't you?

12:23.095 --> 12:26.472
This staff will make
an excellent gift for my father.

12:26.557 --> 12:28.599
I suppose you wouldn't
know of fathers,

12:28.684 --> 12:30.685
being raised by monks.

12:31.311 --> 12:33.229
Take the Avatar to the prison hold

12:33.313 --> 12:34.856
and take this to my quarters.

12:36.734 --> 12:39.694
Hey, you mind taking this
to his quarters for me?

12:55.085 --> 12:58.546
So, I guess you've never fought
an airbender before.

12:58.630 --> 13:00.131
I bet I can take you both

13:00.215 --> 13:01.674
with my hands tied behind my back.

13:01.759 --> 13:02.759
Silence.

13:22.738 --> 13:23.988
The Avatar has escaped!

13:31.038 --> 13:32.038
Go.

13:32.498 --> 13:33.623
Fly.

13:33.707 --> 13:35.083
Soar.

13:36.085 --> 13:38.127
Please, Appa, we need your help.

13:38.212 --> 13:39.420
Aang needs your help.

13:39.505 --> 13:40.505
Up.

13:40.589 --> 13:42.006
Ascend.

13:42.091 --> 13:43.216
Elevate.

13:44.218 --> 13:46.010
Sokka doesn't believe you can fly,

13:46.386 --> 13:47.929
But I do, Appa.

13:48.013 --> 13:50.014
Come on, don't you want to save Aang?

13:53.143 --> 13:54.602
What was it that kid said?

13:54.728 --> 13:55.728
Yee-ha?

13:55.813 --> 13:56.813
Hup-hup?

13:56.897 --> 13:57.897
Wa-hoo?

13:58.315 --> 14:00.108
Yip yip?

14:10.119 --> 14:11.410
You did it, Sokka!

14:12.329 --> 14:14.455
He's flying!

14:14.540 --> 14:16.541
Katara, he's--

14:17.751 --> 14:19.085
I mean, big deal.

14:19.169 --> 14:20.211
He's flying.

14:30.889 --> 14:31.889
Aah!

14:33.267 --> 14:35.143
You haven't seen
my staff around, have you?

14:41.650 --> 14:42.650
Thanks, anyway.

15:07.676 --> 15:08.718
Sorry.

15:16.018 --> 15:17.018
My staff!

15:18.770 --> 15:20.438
Looks like I underestimated you.

16:56.201 --> 16:57.243
What is that?

17:00.580 --> 17:01.580
Appa!

17:22.769 --> 17:24.145
Aang, no!

17:26.356 --> 17:28.607
Aang! Aang!

17:29.276 --> 17:30.401
Aang!

17:57.804 --> 17:59.347
Did you see what he just did?

17:59.431 --> 18:01.891
Now that was some waterbending.

18:10.525 --> 18:12.735
Aang, are you ok?

18:14.780 --> 18:16.405
Hey, Katara.

18:16.490 --> 18:17.698
Hey, Sokka.

18:17.783 --> 18:19.033
Thanks for coming.

18:19.117 --> 18:21.410
Well, I couldn't let you
have all the glory.

18:21.828 --> 18:23.162
I dropped my staff.

18:23.246 --> 18:24.372
Got it.

18:35.675 --> 18:36.675
Ha!

18:36.760 --> 18:38.010
That's from the water tribe!

18:48.230 --> 18:49.230
Katara!

19:00.951 --> 19:02.201
Hurry up, Sokka!

19:02.285 --> 19:04.036
I'm just a guy with a boomerang.

19:04.121 --> 19:06.914
I didn't ask for all this
flying and magic.

19:08.458 --> 19:09.500
Yip yip! Yip yip!

19:22.055 --> 19:23.055
Shoot them down!

19:48.999 --> 19:50.916
Good news for the Fire Lord.

19:51.001 --> 19:53.836
The Fire Nation's greatest threat

19:53.920 --> 19:55.337
is just a little kid.

19:55.797 --> 19:58.757
That kid, uncle, just did this.

19:59.176 --> 20:01.177
I won't underestimate him again.

20:01.678 --> 20:03.429
Dig this ship out and follow them.

20:06.725 --> 20:07.850
As soon as you're done with that.

20:13.940 --> 20:17.443
How did you
do that with the water?

20:17.527 --> 20:19.945
It was the most amazing thing
I've ever seen.

20:20.447 --> 20:21.489
I don't know.

20:21.573 --> 20:23.324
I just sort of did it.

20:24.326 --> 20:27.328
Why didn't you tell us
you were the Avatar?

20:27.829 --> 20:30.581
Because I never wanted to be.

20:41.092 --> 20:44.345
But, Aang, the world's been waiting
for the Avatar to return

20:44.429 --> 20:46.639
and finally put an end to this war.

20:47.057 --> 20:48.891
And how am I going to do that?

20:49.017 --> 20:50.226
According to legend,

20:50.310 --> 20:52.186
You need to first master water,

20:52.270 --> 20:54.271
then earth, then fire, right?

20:54.356 --> 20:55.773
That's what the monks told me.

20:55.857 --> 20:57.858
Well, if we go to the north pole,

20:57.943 --> 20:59.902
you can master waterbending.

20:59.986 --> 21:01.320
We could learn it together!

21:01.821 --> 21:03.906
And, Sokka,
I'm sure you'll get to knock

21:03.990 --> 21:05.616
some firebender heads on the way.

21:05.909 --> 21:06.951
I'd like that.

21:07.035 --> 21:08.494
I'd really like that.

21:09.162 --> 21:10.871
Then we're in this together.

21:10.956 --> 21:12.915
All right,
but before I learn waterbending,

21:12.999 --> 21:15.584
we have some
serious business to attend to

21:15.669 --> 21:18.045
here, here, and here.

21:18.129 --> 21:19.713
What's there?

21:19.798 --> 21:21.882
Here we'll ride the hopping llamas.

21:21.967 --> 21:25.052
Then way over here we'll surf
on the backs of giant koi fish.

21:25.387 --> 21:27.888
Then back over here
we'll ride the hog monkeys.

21:28.139 --> 21:29.765
They don't like people riding them,

21:29.849 --> 21:31.267
but that's what makes it fun!
